+ 5 
+ 6 # Commands
+ 7 
+ 8 - `Save Spec` - save persistent specification (prompt: `sc.save.spec.md`)
+ 9 - `Split Tasks` - create standalone tasks (prompt: `sc.split.tasks.md`)
+10 - `Implement` - run implementation (prompt: `sc.implement.tasks.md`)
